              "text": "Across aligned annual first differences for SWE from 1991 through 2024, the Pearson correlation between annual changes in Domestic credit to private sector (% of GDP) and annual changes in Mobile cellular subscriptions (per 100 people) is 0.161115218727, using 34 aligned transformed observations. This is a Campaign 42 companion to raw package pkg-object-srcpkg-campaign41-swe-private-credit-mobile-cellular-pearson-correlation-v1 and does not supersede it."
